                <pb facs="0482" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg472"/>

                <head>Mr. Merrill to Mr.
                        Gunnison.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Yarmouth,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 14, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Steamer Chesapeake hovering along shore east of Shelburne Saturday night; her
                    purser started by land for Halifax. Gunboat passed here last night four o’clock
                    bound east.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. M. MERRILL, <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consular
                            Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
